OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMost places
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear spells this
OL,7,Fevening and overnight, although a few
OL,8,Flight showers remain possible at
OL,9,Ffirst. Turning rather cold with light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA cold, clear start with
OL,13,Frisk of frost. Then remaining dry and
OL,14,Fsettled through the day with plenty of
OL,15,Fsunny spells and some patchy cloud.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
